+def auto_act(B, ev):
+    """"act": "auto": the speaker acts the words (a nod on "yeah", a shake on "no", a shrug on "dunno", a wave on
+    "hey", a point on a forceful "you", a facepalm on "seriously"), questions end on a brow lift and a tilt, long
+    lines get a thinking glance away, energetic lines wag the tail, and the eyes dart in the pause before a line."""
